  "description": {
    "text": "One of three Battle Strength Sets (バトル強化セット) released in Japan on 26 December 2015, each 16 cards and a player's guide built for two types, here Fire and Lightning. The set has no symbol or number of its own: its eight reprints keep the number, set symbol and rarity of the expansions they come from, and its three new cards, Ninetales-EX, Jolteon-EX and Clemont, are numbered as XY-P promos. Every card but the Pokémon-EX is a normal non-holo card.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site: 一挙公開！「バトル強化セット 炎/雷」",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon-card.com/products/xy/battle/battle_000314.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Fire/Lightning Battle Strength Set (TCG)",
